    "dateLine": "11:30 a.m. Friday, October 9, 2026, Update",
    "excerpt": "This week's weather has been nothing short of spectacular across northern MD, southeastern PA and the Lower Susquehanna Valley. High pressure has promoted lots of sunshine, dry conditions, seasonably cool nights and pleasantly warm afternoons. A weak cold front moved through the Commonwealth from Thursday into Thursday night, but the air mass behind it is similar to the one ahead of it. Moreover, a high pressure system is still situated over eastern Ohio and western PA. …",
